# World 3, mission 7 (Foothills) as a mission (SPEC 13.8). Ctrl+L, W, 7 starts it behind its card (the strip map: the land, the base, four
# lodges and their pads, the hangar). Skill 1 is pinned after the world has loaded (the longest tells, no landed attack) and the chopper is
# in ghost mode (a burst is shown and shrugged off): the same flight every time.
# - the base pad: the home nest is 80 px away and never fires at a chopper landed there; airborne (after the 2 s grace) it tells, the
#   ranging puff shows on the chopper, the burst follows;
# - Ctrl+L, J puts the chopper over the next pad (the four sites' in turn, then the base's), the camera pans to it, and it lands: site 1's, the valley floor: the lodge opens to
#   the cannon, its 16 people come out (4 at a time) and board; then up a little, and the nest on its rise falls to the cannon (zone clear, +200);
# - Ctrl+L, J four more times is the base pad: they unload, run into the hangar: 16 saved. The summit and the shadow on the terrain are
#   screenshots on the way.
# The unit tests (testW3M7*) hold the rules; this is what the player sees. No dropped frames, worst <= 85 % (the pilot's budget).
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x07
wait-serial "AGK world 3 loaded" 400
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x01
wait 30
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x24
wait 30
screenshot card
press fire 2
wait 60
screenshot base
# up: after the take-off grace the home nest tells
press up 30
wait-serial "AGK flak tell" 400
wait 12
screenshot tell
wait-serial "AGK flak burst" 100
wait 3
screenshot burst
# site 1's pad (the valley floor): landed, facing left; turn right and shoot the nest, then left and open the lodge
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x26
wait 150
press down 40
wait 10
screenshot site1
# the lodge first: facing left from the pad, two cannon hits open it, its people come out and board
press fire 1
wait 30
press fire 1
wait-serial "barracks open=0" 100
wait-serial "aboard=16" 900
screenshot boarded
# then the nest on its rise (a shot flying level from the pad meets the slope): up a little, turn right, the cannon
press up 12
wait 25
hold right
wait 25
release
press fire 70
wait-serial "AGK zone clear" 120
wait 20
screenshot nestdown
# the next pads: the mid shelf's, the plateau's, the summit's (the altitude: the shadow's size and the view), then home
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x26
wait 150
press down 40
wait 10
screenshot shelf
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x26
wait 150
press down 40
wait 10
screenshot plateau
press up 20
wait 20
screenshot plateauair
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x26
wait 150
press down 40
wait 10
screenshot summit
press up 40
wait 20
screenshot summitair
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x26
wait 300
press down 40
wait 10
screenshot home
wait-serial "saved=16" 900
wait 60
screenshot saved
expect-serial "AGK world=3 mission=7"
expect-serial "AGK flak tell[\s\S]*AGK flak burst"
expect-serial "AGK zone clear"
expect-serial "AGK barracks open=0"
expect-no-serial "chopper lost|ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
expect-max-load 85
expect-min-chip-free 96
